 "scratch": "设总量为1。上午借出1/4，下午归还1/6（即增加1/6），全天净减少1/3。设下午借出x。方程：1 - 1/4 + 1/6 - x = 1 - 1/3。解得 x = 1/4 + 1/3 - 1/6 = 3/12 + 4/12 - 2/12 = 5/12。",
 "solver_code": "from fractions import Fraction\ndef solve():\n    morning_out = Fraction(1, 4)\n    afternoon_return = Fraction(1, 6)\n    net_decrease = Fraction(1, 3)\n    # Equation: 1 - morning_out + afternoon_return - afternoon_out = 1 - net_decrease\n    # Simplify: - morning_out + afternoon_return - afternoon_out = - net_decrease\n    # afternoon_out = net_decrease - afternoon_return + morning_out\n    afternoon_out = net_decrease - afternoon_return + morning_out\n    return [afternoon_out]",
 "stem": "图书馆统计图书借阅情况，把馆藏总量看作单位“1”。上午借出了总量的 $\\frac{1}{4}$，下午归还了总量的 $\\frac{1}{6}$，已知全天结束时馆藏总量比原来减少了 $\\frac{1}{3}$。下午借出的图书占总量的几分之几？",
